Hello,

I could not confirm receipt of your reading memo by the 11 September deadline=
. There is another opportunity next term if you would like to work on it from=
 the beginning.

You can use paper materials or meet briefly with us to go through the task. P=
lease reply to me or Kathleen by noon on 8 October to tell us which would hel=
p. If you choose paper, we will arrange how to get it to you. The optional me=
eting is planned for 15 October, 12:30=E2=80=9312:50 in Room 2; you may submi=
t even if you do not meet with us.

The attached note explains what to read and what to include. Please submit yo=
ur one-page memo by 22 October at 16:00. Let us know if you need help arrangi=
ng the paper or submission.

Best,
Heather


